@page "/settings"
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<PageTitle>Settings – Safe Passage</PageTitle>
<div class="sp-page-header"><h1 class="sp-page-title">Settings</h1><p class="sp-page-subtitle">System configuration and account controls.</p></div>
<section class="sp-card settings-card"><span class="settings-icon">⚙</span><h2>Configuration is environment-managed</h2><p>The current backend does not expose an organization settings API. The disabled form values that were previously shown here were examples only and did not save anywhere.</p><p>Authentication and device trust requirements can be changed in Security Policies. Server URLs, database settings, and signing keys are configured by the backend environment.</p><a href="/policies">Open Security Policies →</a></section>
<style>.settings-card{max-width:720px;padding:22px}.settings-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:7px;background:#e5f2ed;color:#087f75;font-size:18px}.settings-card h2{font-size:16px;margin:16px 0 8px}.settings-card p{font-size:12px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.65}.settings-card a{font-size:12px;color:#087f75;font-weight:650;text-decoration:none}</style>
